[uses-10] These medicines are not approved for type 1 diabetes, and whether any of them is appropriate for a given person is a decision for their clinician. (source: FDA label, Ozempic; FDA label, Wegovy)
[evid-1] STEP-1 randomised 1961 adults with obesity (BMI of 30 or more) or overweight (BMI of 27 or more) with at least 1 weight-related condition, without diabetes, to semaglutide 2.4 mg once weekly or placebo for 68 weeks, both with lifestyle intervention. (source: STEP-1, Wilding, NEJM 2021)
